{"unit_id":"huhuai-ni__dsh-clock#readme-1","repo":"huhuai-ni/dsh-clock","commit":"fff178349b24fee9f119af59bc5b6274ec0762c2","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clock README · dsh-clock：DSH 插件：**让 AI 知道现在几点。**","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-clock"}
{"unit_id":"huhuai-ni__dsh-clock#readme-2","repo":"huhuai-ni/dsh-clock","commit":"fff178349b24fee9f119af59bc5b6274ec0762c2","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clock README · 为什么需要它：AI 分不清「下午五点」和「凌晨五点」，于是会说「夜深了，早点睡」——而对面可能刚吃完午饭。\n\n这个插件给模型三个工具，让它开口前先看一眼钟。","source":"extracted","section":"为什么需要它"}
{"unit_id":"huhuai-ni__dsh-clock#readme-3","repo":"huhuai-ni/dsh-clock","commit":"fff178349b24fee9f119af59bc5b6274ec0762c2","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clock README · 工具：| 工具 | 作用 |\n|---|---|\n| `clock_now` | 本地时间、星期、**时段**、今天过了多少、**该怎么开口** |\n| `clock_until` | 距离某个时刻还有多久（如「还有 5 小时 46 分钟到 23:00」） |\n| `clock_diff` | 两个时间点差多久 |\n\n`clock_now` 返回里有一个 `hint` 字段，是给模型的口吻建议：\n\n```\n早上  → 说「早」比说「晚安」对\n下午  → 别用「夜深了」「早点睡」这类话\n深夜  → 别硬聊，问一句要不要睡\n```","source":"extracted","section":"工具"}
{"unit_id":"huhuai-ni__dsh-clock#readme-4","repo":"huhuai-ni/dsh-clock","commit":"fff178349b24fee9f119af59bc5b6274ec0762c2","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clock README · 安装：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-clock\n```\n\n无配置、无依赖、无网络请求。","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
